# Citation metadata, read by GitHub and by reference managers.
# GitHub renders a "Cite this repository" button from this file.
#
# This matters more than the licence for keeping the work attributed: a licence
# cannot reach a paper's acknowledgements, but a citation convention can.
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Anthriq Algorithms
message: If you use this software in published work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Research Team, Anthriq (Nexstem India Private Limited)"
    website: https://anthriq.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Anthriq/Anthriq-algorithms
abstract: >-
  Open-source biosignal (EXG) analysis scripts for EEG, ECG, EMG and EOG
  recordings, covering alpha reactivity, steady-state visually evoked
  potentials, and common-mode rejection measurement.
keywords:
  - eeg
  - exg
  - biosignal
  - electrophysiology
  - brain-computer-interface
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
